{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "7920467b970d68f58ba9722f3115aa3fd02484823b26a6071b332ef3633c1547", "ja": "フリーダムでいこう", "zh": "自由自在地走下去", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5996ce0bc772625c45accbc23c379ec4ba978870cb2fde34f8d3e9b65de5351f", "ja": "記念公演の振り付けを担当することになった\n歩だったが、集まった自由奔放なメンバー達\nに振り回されることに。", "zh": "歩负责了纪念公演的编舞工作，却被聚集而来的自由奔放的成员们搞得团团转。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_04_1000_001har", "source_sha256": "d18378f25dc52afd29eab82e20eca61c8466dd72eaf4e2941ef0cf45237222d8", "ja": "コホン！　えー、今回の記念公演、振り付け担当は\n歩ちゃん……ううん、歩先生ですっ！", "zh": "咳咳！呃～，这次纪念公演的编舞负责人是步……不对，\n是步老师！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_04_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "4ee0d6df9b9b5c2dc8b9f5c0615e9c7c384805f7beacf7c96147a7b12fd0eaf1", "ja": "よろしくねっ、歩先生！\nゴリゴリのダンスでもモノにしてみせるさーっ！", "zh": "请多关照，步老师！\n就算是超硬核的舞蹈，我也一定能掌握的啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_04_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "92a0aeb72127233a23fc2bdf453e1fd02a09602ec8a5d71c9728337d2a2e18b3", "ja": "すっげーじゃん、歩先生！\nパンフとかに名前載っちゃうんじゃないの～？", "zh": "太厉害了吧，步老师！\n名字说不定都要登上宣传册之类的地方了～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_04_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "257a7154f556c217c02ea68cbf001a183fad98f814bc13bd6bd9bf28c6e3262e", "ja": "えへへ、歩先生はやめてよ！　照れるな～。\n歩ちゃんでもあゆあゆでも、好きに呼んでいいから。", "zh": "嘿嘿，别叫我步老师啦！会害羞的～  \n叫我小步或者阿步都行，随你喜欢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_04_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "20d2cb3b7fed82e045b8f3fa3f4a6b2b768c1064fecf118065375fb3792984bf", "ja": "じゃあ、マイハマンさー、早速だけど……", "zh": "那么，舞滨小姐，虽然有点突然……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_04_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ebda7adbd1330c7ba5f165df8c54b7382f824fd5164eec7ec79c6c7d981ac895", "ja": "え！？　昴はそんな呼び方したことなかったよね！？", "zh": "诶！？昴以前没这么叫过吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_04_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "d34ff3e9e42f1a68aaded5e3d450ddbdbc5e4867116902837d29bf2f74edef2c", "ja": "あゆあゆ、課題曲のUSBメモリ、\nここに置いておくね。", "zh": "步步，课题曲的U盘，\n我放在这里哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_04_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "6e04ff82c73c2f116fc997ff67007acf4559e55239fde53142485f02269c180a", "ja": "あゆむんむーん！\n始める前に飲み物買ってきていい？", "zh": "步步步～！\n开始之前我可以去买个饮料吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_04_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "cc1eee7244261af0b28380974cc7dc095c52b3d9738db5a9c36f2e1052ec9d9d", "ja": "好きに呼ぶ会始まっちゃったよ！\nマイガー！", "zh": "随便乱叫大赛已经开始了啊！\n我的天啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_04_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "568544afa6fdb87e51bae6c2a54e045a7e741ddd67a93b6048ba1e47c425565e", "ja": "えへへっ、ごめんね！\n歩ちゃんの反応が可愛くて、つい……。", "zh": "诶嘿嘿，对不起嘛！\n小步的反应太可爱了，一不小心就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_04_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7baf205446352b28fb75908f51bbaa10aa59fb41381178abe908c4c96187a172", "ja": "アタシで遊ばないでよ～！　コホン……んじゃ、\n気を取り直して……みんなで振り付けを決めてくよ！", "zh": "别拿我寻开心啦～！咳咳……那就，\n重新振作起来……大家一起决定舞蹈动作吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_04_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "0714ad199c78c44593a0172a6b16e1906b2165e42fc07a0224a3193fd9ec3cf0", "ja": "自分、頭を床につけてくるくる～って回るやつ\nやってみたい！　ステージでダンス対決しようよ！", "zh": "我想试试那种把头贴在地板上转啊转的动作！在舞台上来场舞蹈对决吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_04_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "5e69294367f35e11622afbe974f1b150f2fe80289f1e922c70f9ac283f9bc44b", "ja": "パルクールやろうよパルクール！\nやったことないけど、カッコいいじゃん！", "zh": "一起玩跑酷吧，跑酷！\n虽然我没做过，但很帅气嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_04_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ecf4027a5e866a028bce7e9206925d886e6f0ee37566885cebd92a51a9bdbafb", "ja": "マイガー！　まとまらないよ、このメンバー……\nヘルプミー、{$P$}！", "zh": "我的天！这群人根本没法统一起来……救救我，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_04_1014_001har", "source_sha256": "9bf3d16563606c30aaf840f11539e148c0d273dfe286bea145a6dde893522373", "ja": "あはは……。\nちゃんと踊れる振り付けになるのかな～？", "zh": "啊哈哈……  \n这样能编成大家都好好跳的舞吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
